sequenceDiagram
    actor Caller
    participant PE as HttpPipeline<br/>(IHttpExecutor)
    participant VS as VariableSubstitution<br/>Step (Order=10)
    participant SE as ScriptExecution<br/>Step (Order=50)
    participant EX as HttpExecutor<br/>(terminal)

    Note over PE: ExecuteAsync(model) called
    Caller->>PE: ExecuteAsync(model, ct)

    Note over PE: Snapshot of registered steps<br/>BuildPipeline() — Aggregate

    PE->>VS: InvokeAsync(context, next, ct)

    Note over VS: PRE: substitute {{variables}}<br/>context.Request mutated
    VS->>SE: next() → InvokeAsync(context, next, ct)

    Note over SE: PRE: run pre-request script<br/>context.Request still mutable
    SE->>EX: next() → ExecuteAsync(context.Request, ct)

    Note over EX: Actual HTTP call<br/>context.Result set
    EX-->>SE: context.Result set

    Note over SE: POST: run post-response script<br/>context.Result readable / mutable
    SE-->>VS: return

    Note over VS: POST: (optional processing)
    VS-->>PE: return

    PE-->>Caller: context.Result (HttpExecutionResult)

    Note over Caller: Unaware of the pipeline,<br/>only calls IHttpExecutor
